{"comment":"The failure matrix. The step appExit {code, stderr} ends the process of the app with its exit code and the lines that it wrote to stderr before. Each new process is a new app link, and its ids start at 1 again. The steps clock move the clock of air-ide, so the backoff of the restarts runs without a wait. The step pageLoad {url} is the load of the host document by the IDE, and pageTicket {ticket} the call window.airAppHost.connect(ticket) of the IDE in a loaded page; a runner of air-ide skips both."}
